{"id":"01442afa54980587","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-symmetric-encryption.md","title":"Symmetric Encryption","display":"df-symmetric-encryption — Symmetric Encryption","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-symmetric-encryption","aliases":["28-df-symmetric-encryption","Symmetric Encryption Scheme"],"display":"df-symmetric-encryption — Symmetric Encryption","depends_on":["[[28-df-ppt]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"source_book_location":"§9.1 encryption and §9.5.1 many-message construction; printed pp.171–174,191; PDF pp.197–200,217","source_printed_pages":"171–174,191","source_pdf_pages":"197–200,217","source_status":"supplementary-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-symmetric-encryption"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-symmetric-encryption</span><span>Symmetric Encryption Scheme</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-symmetric-encryption — Symmetric Encryption"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§9.1 encryption and §9.5.1 many-message construction; printed pp.171–174,191; PDF pp.197–200,217"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"171–174,191"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"197–200,217"},{"key":"source_status","html":"supplementary-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Enc},\\operatorname{Dec},(\\mathcal K_n,\\mathcal M_n,\\mathcal C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N})\">\\(\\Pi=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Enc},\\operatorname{Dec},(\\mathcal K_n,\\mathcal M_n,\\mathcal C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Enc}\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\">\\(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Enc}\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dec}\\in\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\operatorname{Dec}\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>。</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_n,\\mathcal M_n,\\mathcal C_n\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\mathcal K_n,\\mathcal M_n,\\mathcal C_n\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 为非空有限密钥、消息、密文集合，其元素长度均以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的多项式统一有界；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\bot\\notin\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 为失败符号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n)\">\\(\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n)\\)</span> 支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_n\">\\(\\mathcal K_n\\)</span>；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathcal K_n,m\\in\\mathcal M_n\">\\(k\\in\\mathcal K_n,m\\in\\mathcal M_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Enc}_k(m)\">\\(\\operatorname{Enc}_k(m)\\)</span> 支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_n\">\\(\\mathcal C_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dec}(1^n,k,c)\\in\\{0w:w\\in\\mathcal M_n\\}\\cup\\{1\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Dec}(1^n,k,c)\\in\\{0w:w\\in\\mathcal M_n\\}\\cup\\{1\\}\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathcal K_n,c\\in\\mathcal C_n\">\\(k\\in\\mathcal K_n,c\\in\\mathcal C_n\\)</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dec}_k:\\mathcal C_n\\to\\mathcal M_n\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Dec}_k:\\mathcal C_n\\to\\mathcal M_n\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\\)</span> 是下式定义的数学解密值。所有输入均使用规范配对编码，分别给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^n,k,m\">\\(1^n,k,m\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^n,k,c\">\\(1^n,k,c\\)</span>；在当前绑定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Enc}_k(m)\">\\(\\operatorname{Enc}_k(m)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dec}_k(c)\">\\(\\operatorname{Dec}_k(c)\\)</span> 分别缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Enc}(1^n,k,m)\">\\(\\operatorname{Enc}(1^n,k,m)\\)</span> 与下式的标记输出解码值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Correct}(\\Pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Correct}(\\Pi)\\)</span> 是完全正确性谓词；概率取遍密钥生成和每次加密的独立随机性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dec}_k(c)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w&amp;\\operatorname{Dec}(1^n,k,c)=0w,\\ w\\in\\mathcal M_n,\\\\\\bot&amp;\\operatorname{Dec}(1^n,k,c)=1.\\end{cases}\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ k\\in\\mathcal K_n,\\ c\\in\\mathcal C_n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Dec}_k(c)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w&amp;\\operatorname{Dec}(1^n,k,c)=0w,\\ w\\in\\mathcal M_n,\\\\\\bot&amp;\\operatorname{Dec}(1^n,k,c)=1.\\end{cases}\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ k\\in\\mathcal K_n,\\ c\\in\\mathcal C_n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Correct}(\\Pi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathcal M_n\\;\\Pr_{k\\leftarrow\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n),\\;c\\leftarrow\\operatorname{Enc}_k(m)}[\\operatorname{Dec}_k(c)=m]=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Correct}(\\Pi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathcal M_n\\;\\Pr_{k\\leftarrow\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n),\\;c\\leftarrow\\operatorname{Enc}_k(m)}[\\operatorname{Dec}_k(c)=m]=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第 9.1 节先给出固定密钥的确定型加解密接口，§9.5.1 的多次消息加密使用新鲜随机串。这里补成附带域族的随机算法结构并采用与原书可逆加密一致的完全正确性；可忽略解密错误是另一个较宽变体，不能让错误概率的随机性只在 Remark 中解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$\\Pi=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Enc},\\operatorname{Dec},(\\mathcal K_n,\\mathcal M_n,\\mathcal C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N})$；$\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Enc}\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$，$\\operatorname{Dec}\\in\\mathbf{FP}$，见 [[28-df-ppt]]、[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-4","t