C_n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Correct}(\\Pi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathcal M_n\\;\\Pr_{k\\leftarrow\\operatorname{Gen}(1^n),\\;c\\leftarrow\\operatorname{Enc}_k(m)}[\\operatorname{Dec}_k(c)=m]=1.","display":true}],"bytes":2682,"backlinks":[{"id":"84a4c3a277344dd9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Pi=(\\operatorname{Gen},\\operatorname{Enc},\\operatorname{Dec},(\\mathcal K_n,\\mathcal M_n,\\mathcal C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N})$ 为 [[28-df-symmetric-encryption]] 的正确对称加密方案；$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{FP}$、$\\operatorname{tup}_j$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]，$\\mathbf{PPT}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见所列本地定义。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-161","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"密码方案：[[28-df-symmetric-encryption]]、[[28-df-ind-cpa]]、[[28-df-trapdoor-permutation]]、[[28-df-digital-signature]]。"}],"outgoing":["b75200f005282ddf","adb92775ec020a0b"]}